        </mj-text>

        <mj-text mj-class="footer-small" padding-bottom="15px" font-style="italic">
          *Free delivery only for non-discounted products from the new collection.
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text mj-class="footer-small" line-height="1.6">
          You have received this email on behalf of ITX USA LLC. and/or STRADIVARIUS ESPAÑA, S.A. because you have previously authorised us to send you commercial communications from STRADIVARIUS. Please remember that you can obtain further information about how we use your personal data and what your rights are in the Privacy Policy available on the STRADIVARIUS website.
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text mj-class="footer-small" padding-top="20px">
          If you want to unsubscribe <a href="#" style="color: #9D9D9C; text-decoration: underline;">click here.</a>
        </mj-text>

      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

